{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/73846-tell-me-about-mortal-remains","id":73846,"title":"Tell me about Mortal Remains?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-17T13:07:51-08:00","id":73846,"title":"Tell me about Mortal Remains?","content":"I've heard of this book, which I want. Is it out yet? If not, when? Where can I purchase it?<br /> <br /> Sorry for the stupid questions! I tried using Google and came up empty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T13:34:48-08:00","id":73858,"title":"","content":"Its not out yet. If you go to Onxy Path Publishing's Main Site, they have a schedule at the top: here it is <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/schedule/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/schedule/</a> Looks like its due in March. I'm a little fuzzy on how their steps work, its on step 5 so it would appear that the book is ready for CCP to approve and that is in progress or that they are still working on layout. RPG Drive Through has the exclusive on sales of new books so expect it there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1881-the-cowardly-scion","name":"The Cowardly Scion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1881_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T13:38:21-08:00","id":73862,"title":"","content":"While most of the previous Hunter's supplements covered the &quot;Big Three&quot; (respectively, &quot;Witch Finders&quot; for Mage, &quot;Night Stalkers&quot; for Vampire and &quot;Spirit Slayers&quot; for Werewolf), Mortal Remains covers what's left, from Promethean to Demon. It will detail how Hunters interact with such monster and include simplified systems and mechanics to feature them in a Hunter game. I've read it also includes new organizations of hunters focused on killing Demons and Mummies, but I'm not sure if we're going to get new groups for the other lines as well. It will also include the GMC update for Hunter.<br /> <br /> It is not out yet, but the Onyx Path schedule says it's going to be released on March. As for where you can purchase it, it's DriveThruRPG as always <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Hope this helps.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Oh, here's a link to a preview of the book machineiv posted on the Onyx Path site a couple of months ago. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/hunter-the-vigil-the-faithful-of-shulpae/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/hunter-the-vi...ul-of-shulpae/</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 02-17-2014, 04:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T17:23:33-08:00","id":75336,"title":"","content":"NIce, I like Hunter's broad focus. More of the same is good in this case.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T19:48:16-08:00","id":76050,"title":"","content":"It's got chapters on each of the non-Big Three gamelines (Prometheans, Changelings, Sin-Eaters, Mummies, Demons), plus an update of Hunter: the Vigil to the GMC rules. It has two new Compacts and two new Conspiracies, one of each for Mummy and Demon. The Mummy Conspiracy is the aforementioned Faithful of Shulpae, who can eat the flesh of monsters to gain their powers, and the Demon Conspiracy is a group of truckers and bounty hunters empowered by the God-Machine to hunt down the Unchained. It should be coming out in March.<br /> <br /> I'm excited.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T20:48:56-08:00","id":76081,"title":"","content":"They should really put new Compacts and Conspiracies in for Prometheans, Changelings and Sin-Eaters.<br /> <br /> I would kickstart for the book to be expanded for that, or something. <br /> <br /> I could see doing 1 Compact and 1 Conspiracy for each. That'd be fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","name":"Professor Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T21:32:28-08:00","id":76091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div cla